## 2. Repository & Rojo Mapping (`default.project.json`)
Map the project into three top-level containers so updates can be dragged-and-dropped into Roblox Studio in seconds:
- **`src/shared` → `ReplicatedStorage.Shared`** (`ModuleScript`s only):
  - `src/shared/Core/` — **Pure game rules & math** (no Roblox `Instance` / `Workspace` / `Players` APIs). Because these modules are pure Luau, they run directly in the standalone `luau` CLI for instant unit testing.
  - `src/shared/Art/` — **Procedural 3D map, hub, prop, and character builders** (`HubArt.luau`, `MapRegistry.luau`, etc.). Every map and prop is constructed programmatically from `Part`, `WedgePart`, `CornerWedgePart`, `Cylinder`, `Ball`, `PointLight`, `SurfaceLight`, and `SurfaceGui` instances.
  - `src/shared/Net.luau` — Centralized `RemoteEvent` / `RemoteFunction` helper under `ReplicatedStorage`.
  - `src/shared/Assets.luau` & `src/shared/Audio.luau` — Single dictionary of all `rbxassetid://` sound and music IDs with safe fallback when an ID is empty.
  - `src/shared/Monetization.luau` — Single source of truth for GamePass IDs, Developer Product IDs, and Group ID.
- **`src/server` → `ServerScriptService.Server`**:
  - `src/server/Main.server.luau` — Single server entrypoint that initializes services in deterministic order.
  - `src/server/Services/` — Modular server services (`DataService.luau`, `RoundService.luau`, `ShopService.luau`, `HubService.luau`, `BotService.luau`, etc.).
  - `src/server/Bots/` — Server-driven AI bot brains and navigation so rounds are always playable solo or with partial lobbies, with seamless human takeover when a real player joins.
- **`src/client` → `StarterPlayer.StarterPlayerScripts.Client`**:
  - Modular `.client.luau` controllers (`RoundHud.client.luau`, `ShopUi.client.luau`, `HubController.client.luau`, `MusicController.client.luau`, `DevPanel.client.luau`, etc.). All UI (`ScreenGui`, `BillboardGui`, `ProximityPrompt`) is created in Luau code using `UIScale` / responsive sizing.
- **`tests/`**:
  - Fast unit tests (`tests/run.luau` + `tests/*.spec.luau`) executed via `luau tests/run.luau` testing all `src/shared/Core/` modules.

