## 5. Mandatory Verification & `.rbxm` Delivery Pipeline
Before finishing any task or pushing to GitHub, run the full check and build pipeline:
1. **Format:** `stylua src tests`
2. **Lint:** `selene src tests` (must pass with `0 errors, 0 warnings`)
3. **Unit Tests:** `luau tests/run.luau` (all tests must pass)
4. **Flicker Check:** `lune run tools/preview/export.luau zfight` (`0 problem faces`)
5. **Typecheck:** `rojo sourcemap default.project.json -o .cache/sourcemap.json` followed by `luau-lsp analyze` (`0` errors)
6. **Build Studio Packages (`.rbxm`) & Push to GitHub:**
   Build standalone `.rbxm` models for the 3 folders and commit them to the repo root so they can be downloaded with one click:
   ```powershell
   '{"name":"Shared","tree":{"$path":"src/shared"}}' | Set-Content shared.project.json
   '{"name":"Server","tree":{"$path":"src/server"}}' | Set-Content server.project.json
   '{"name":"Client","tree":{"$path":"src/client"}}' | Set-Content client.project.json
   rojo build shared.project.json -o Shared.rbxm
   rojo build server.project.json -o Server.rbxm
   rojo build client.project.json -o Client.rbxm
   Remove-Item shared.project.json, server.project.json, client.project.json
   ```
7. **Always provide direct GitHub raw download links** in your final response so the user can download and replace `ReplicatedStorage > Shared`, `ServerScriptService > Server`, and `StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts > Client` in Roblox Studio in one click:
   - `https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/raw/main/Shared.rbxm`
   - `https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/raw/main/Server.rbxm`
   - `https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/raw/main/Client.rbxm`
